# Copy to .env. .env itself is gitignored — never commit it.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL is the only var the app actually reads (src/lib/config.ts,
# via import.meta.env) — without it, the app falls back to a stale port-8000
# default that doesn't match this project's real backend port (8001, see
# app/backend/.env.example / docker-compose.yml). Set it explicitly here so
# a fresh clone works out of the box.
#
# The dev server's own port (5174, matching start.ps1 and everywhere else in
# this repo that assumes it) is now vite.config.ts's own default — nothing
# to set here for that; a VITE_PORT var here would NOT work anyway, since
# vite.config.ts reads process.env directly and doesn't load this file into
# its own process (only import.meta.env, for application code, does).

VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8001
